      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.east-texas.com/alto-texas.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Just six miles west of Alto lies the Caddo Mounds State Historic Site, where three earthen mounds still rise from the Pineywoods landscape.",
